Attribution:
  era labs (ora.ai). (2026). Jev and the agentic web dataset: per-run durations and verified
  task outcomes for agents with and without Jev, on a browser, WebMCP tools and NLWeb search,
  across 240 runs. era labs. Data released under CC BY 4.0.

The dataset contains machine-recorded observations from agent runs against a self-hosted,
seeded benchmark site (per-run wall time, per-task pass/fail verified against live state or
the exact answer) plus the verbatim task definitions. Raw traces (page snapshots, element
tables, model transcripts) are not redistributed.
